    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><ul><li>03 - Proposed Plans - 03/2025</li><li>04 - Proposed Elevations - 03/2025</li><li>05 - Proposed Section - 03/2025</li><li>07 - Proposed Block Plan - 03/2025</li><li>09 - Cycle Storage Details - 03/2025</li><li>Supporting Statement - 03/2025</li><li>Location Plan - 26/03/2025</li></ul><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>"
